+---
+id: dl-003-long-rental-discount-rules
+type: decision-log
+title: "Long rental discount rules"
+status: pending
+---
+
+# Long rental discount rules
+
+## Context
+Customers who stay longer are rewarded: a rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price.
+Money is integer cents (dl-001), so a 10% reduction can fall between two cents.
+
+## Decision
+- The discount applies from 3 whole days (`end` - `start` >= 3 days, half-open period of dl-001); 1 and 2
+  days are charged at the full price.
+- It is a flat 10% of the whole total (`days * dailyPrice`), not of the days beyond the third.
+- The discounted total is rounded to the nearest cent, halves up, with integer arithmetic only
+  (`floor((total * 9 + 5) / 10)`), so it is deterministic.
+- `quote` and `book` share one pricing path, so a booking always carries the quoted, reduced total.
+
+## Consequences
+Existing 3-day-or-longer quotes change (e.g. 3 days at 2500 cents: 7500 -> 6750). The threshold and rate
+are constants in `src/index.ts`; changing them later is a one-line edit.
